    ]
  },
  "A2-7-1": {
    "kind": "compare",
    "point": "Imperatives and infinitives for giving suggestions",
    "title": "Three ways to suggest",
    "note_es": "Puedes dar una instrucción directa, suavizarla con Try o Please, o usar it's a good idea to + verbo.",
    "columns": [
